slices\S01\tasks\T03-SUMMARY.md :: T03: Executed probe eval and established accuracy baseline.
  bold: Executed probe eval and established accuracy baseline.
  metrics: accuracy baseline. | accuracy baseline.** | 0% exact accuracy and 8.3% close accuracy. The model appears to be repeating few-shot `oilSurfaceYRatio` values verbatim, as predicted in the remediation plan. Analysis of worst misses shows significant errors in boundary detection (e.g., predicting 962ml for a 1485ml bottle). This baseline provides a clear target for improvement in the next slice.
slices\S02\S02-ASSESSMENT.md :: S02 Assessment
  bold: Milestone:
  metrics: failed to improve performance, with MAE actually increasing. We need a remediation phase to test a 'Quality over Quantity' approach with fewer, higher-quality shots and potentially enabling thinking capabilities or explicit chain-of-thought (CoT). Running the full dev set validation (S03) is premature while the probe performance is still this poor.
slices\S02\S02-CONTINUE.md :: S02-CONTINUE.md
